        "description": "Press [BASIC] to activate:\n\nLaunch up to four strikes forward, dealing Physical DMG and Electric DMG. During the 3rd hit, repeatedly press [BASIC] to continue the attack, continuously striking the enemy. Using /bDodge//b during this period will not interrupt Qingyi's /bBasic Attack//b combo count.\n\nDuring the 3rd hit, stop pressing [BASIC] to interrupt the continuous attack, transitioning automatically to the 4th hit. If the continuous attack lasts for a certain time, the 4th hit will be enhanced. Anti-Interrupt Level is increased and DMG received is reduced by 40% during the 3rd and 4th hit.",
